7741 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[1 .92 0]/P 17 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[53.880105 426.85426 385.69203 426.85426 53.880105 416.89167 385.69203 416.89167 53.88011 414.85426 385.82048 414.85426 53.88011 404.89167 385.82048 404.89167 53.88011 402.85426 197.53673 402.85426 53.88011 392.89167 197.53673 392.89167]/Rect[51.531824 392.269 388.16877 427.4769]/AP<</N 7742 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/Contents([Bab 2 Subbab 2.1.3 Business Process Model and Notation \(Hlm. 35-36\) - Definisi Business Process Management \(BPM\) & Peningkatan Proses Bisnis]\n\nKalimat Kutipan/Elaborasi di Skripsi ARTHA:\n"Business Process Management \(BPM\) adalah seni dan ilmu mengawasi bagaimana pekerjaan dijalankan di dalam suatu organisasi untuk memastikan hasil yang konsisten dan memanfaatkan peluang perbaikan seperti pengurangan waktu eksekusi dan tingkat kesalahan \(Dumas dkk., 2018\)."\n\nKalimat Bukti di Jurnal/Buku \(Hlm. 29\):\n"Business Process Management \(BPM\) is the art and science of overseeing how work is performed in an organization to ensure consistent outcomes and to take advan- tage of improvement opportunities.")/T(Kutipan Skripsi ARTHA \(Bab 2 Subbab 2.1.3 Business Process Model and Notation \(Hlm. 35-36\) - Definisi Business Process Management \(BPM\) & Peningkatan Proses Bisnis\))/Subj(Bukti Sitasi Skripsi ARTHA)/Popup 7743 0 R/BM/Multiply>>
endobj

