7744 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[1 .92 0]/P 868 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[161.94078 278.05357 385.7179 278.05357 161.94078 268.09098 385.7179 268.09098 53.877496 266.05357 275.6016 266.05357 53.877496 256.09098 275.6016 256.09098]/Rect[51.529214 255.4683 388.06617 278.6762]/AP<</N 7745 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/Contents([Bab 2 Subbab 2.1.3 BPMN & Tabel 2.1 \(Hlm. 35-37\) - Elemen Inti BPMN: Activity/Task, Start Event, End Event, dan Sequence Flow]\n\nKalimat Kutipan/Elaborasi di Skripsi ARTHA:\n"Proses bisnis dalam BPMN terdiri dari rangkaian aktivitas \(activities/tasks\), kejadian awal \(start events yang digambarkan dengan lingkaran bergaris tipis\), kejadian akhir \(end events dengan lingkaran bergaris tebal\), serta alur urutan \(sequence flows\) \(Dumas dkk., 2018\)."\n\nKalimat Bukti di Jurnal/Buku \(Hlm. 102\):\n"We use circles with a thin border to capture start events and circles with a thick border to capture end events.")/T(Kutipan Skripsi ARTHA \(Bab 2 Subbab 2.1.3 BPMN & Tabel 2.1 \(Hlm. 35-37\) - Elemen Inti BPMN: Activity/Task, Start Event, End Event, dan Sequence Flow\))/Subj(Bukti Sitasi Skripsi ARTHA)/Popup 7746 0 R/BM/Multiply>>
endobj

