7750 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Highlight/C[1 .92 0]/P 2043 0 R/F 4/QuadPoints[65.76019 518.7743 385.69114 518.7743 65.76019 508.8117 385.69114 508.8117 53.879693 506.7743 158.17189 506.7743 53.879693 496.8117 158.17189 496.8117]/Rect[51.53141 496.18907 388.03944 519.397]/AP<</N 7751 0 R>>/NM(fitz-A0)/Contents([Bab 2 Subbab 2.1.3 BPMN & Tabel 2.1 \(Hlm. 35-39\) - Kombinasi Activities, Events, dan Gateways serta Sintaks dan Semantik Notasi BPMN]\n\nKalimat Kutipan/Elaborasi di Skripsi ARTHA:\n"Menggabungkan elemen activities, events, dan gateways beserta aturan sintaks dan semantik notasi BPMN untuk memodelkan logika alur kerja proses bisnis organisasi secara presisi \(Dumas dkk., 2018\)."\n\nKalimat Bukti di Jurnal/Buku \(Hlm. 118\):\n"We have learned how to combine activities, events and gateways to model basic business processes.")/T(Kutipan Skripsi ARTHA \(Bab 2 Subbab 2.1.3 BPMN & Tabel 2.1 \(Hlm. 35-39\) - Kombinasi Activities, Events, dan Gateways serta Sintaks dan Semantik Notasi BPMN\))/Subj(Bukti Sitasi Skripsi ARTHA)/Popup 7752 0 R/BM/Multiply>>
